{
  "category": "reflection-stories",
  "title": "The Way Back",
  "slug": "the-way-back",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-13T10:00:00.000Z",
  "draft": false,
  "excerpt": "They had a rule. If one of them got quiet for too long, the other could just say: “Hey. Come back to me.”",
  "body": {
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "They had a rule."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If one of them got quiet for too long, the other could just say:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Hey. Come back to me.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "No drama. No explanations. Just a reset."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "It started because he had a habit of shutting down when he was stressed. Not in a big obvious way — just… disappearing into silence."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One night, it happened again. Dinner was half-eaten. The conversation had quietly died somewhere between “How was your day?” and “Fine.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "She looked at him and said, half-smiling:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Hey. Come back to me.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "He blinked. “I’m right here.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "She nodded. “Emotionally, you’re on airplane mode.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "That got him."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "He let out a short laugh. Then shook his head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Okay, fair.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A pause."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Let me reboot.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Good,” she said. “We’re discussing something important.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“What’s that?”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Dessert.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "He leaned back, a little more present now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“Then I’m definitely back,” he said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "And that became their thing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Not perfect communication. Not always knowing what to say."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Just the ability to notice when the other one drifts…"
          },
          {
            "type": "break",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and gently pull each other back."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
